<title>USA: Nova Technologies Inc changes name.</title>
<headline>Nova Technologies Inc changes name.</headline>
<dateline>BRISTOL, Conn. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nova Technologies Inc, provider of specialized hospital bed systems and medical equipment, said it changed its name to Vivax Medical Corp on Tuesday and applied for a new symbol on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
<p>The company, trading under Nasdaq symbol &quot;NOTL&quot; on the OTC Bulletin board, has applied for a new symbol -- &quot;VIVX.&quot;</p>
<p>Vivax Medical develops, manufactures, distributes and is a service provider of complex medical equipment.</p>
</text>
